---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
const lang = 'en';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Terms and Conditions - Las Biala's Cottages | Rental Terms"
  description="Terms and conditions for renting the Las Biala's cottages in Biała. Booking, deposit, cancellation, check-in and check-out."
  lang={lang}
>
  <div class="container mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="mb-4 text-4xl font-semibold">Terms and Conditions of Rental and Stay</h1>
    <p class="mb-8 text-base leading-relaxed">The following terms and conditions have been prepared to ensure a comfortable, safe and pleasant stay for all Guests. By making a booking, you accept these terms.</p>
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <h2>1. Booking and Payment</h2>
      <p>The lessor of the property is Talem Technologies sp. z o.o., registered in Bydgoszcz (85-052), ul. Cieszkowskiego 22/U1, Poland. Tax ID (NIP): 9671241356. Contact details: <a href="mailto:domki@lasbialas.pl">domki@lasbialas.pl</a></p>
      <ul>
        <li>Bookings can be made via the lasbialas.pl website, by email at domki@lasbialas.pl, by phone at +48 789 773 285 or via WhatsApp at +48 660 194 187.</li>
        <li>The minimum stay is 2 nights.</li>
        <li>A booking becomes binding once the Lessor has confirmed it by email and the deposit (“zadatek”) has been received. The deposit amounts to 30% of the price of the stay for bookings over 1,500 PLN, or 450 PLN for bookings up to 1,500 PLN. Information on the available payment methods is provided in the confirmation email.</li>
        <li>The deposit must be paid within 24 hours of receiving the confirmation email. If it is not received within this time, the booking will be cancelled. The deposit is applied towards the total price.</li>
        <li>Bookings for public holidays, long weekends and the summer holiday period may require a deposit of 40–50%. Bookings made less than 7 days before arrival may require full prepayment.</li>
        <li>The remaining balance is payable on site upon arrival: in cash, by bank transfer or via BLIK, using the details provided in the confirmation email.</li>
        <li>If you require a VAT invoice, please provide your details when booking or send them to <a href="mailto:domki@lasbialas.pl">domki@lasbialas.pl</a>.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. Cancellation and Change of Dates</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Under Article 16(l) of Directive 2011/83/EU on consumer rights (implemented in Poland by Article 38 of the Consumer Rights Act), the right of withdrawal does not apply to contracts for accommodation services provided on a specific date or for a specific period.</li>
        <li>Regardless of the above, Guests may cancel their booking no later than 14 days before the planned arrival without losing the deposit. In this case, the deposit is transferred to a booking for another agreed date, which must fall no later than 3 months after the date of cancellation. After this period, the deposit is forfeited.</li>
        <li>Cancellations made less than 14 days before the planned arrival result in forfeiture of the deposit in favour of the Lessor.</li>
        <li>A change of dates is possible subject to availability and requires confirmation by the Lessor.</li>
        <li>Bookings made through third-party platforms (Booking.com, Airbnb, AlohaCamp) are subject to the payment and cancellation terms of the respective platform.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Check-in and Check-out</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>The stay begins at 16:00 on the day of arrival and ends at 12:00 on the day of departure.</li>
        <li>Early check-in or an extended stay must be arranged individually.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Safety and Restrictions</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Smoking cigarettes, e-cigarettes and narcotic substances, including any products and mixtures intended for smoking, is prohibited inside the cottages.</li>
        <li>For safety reasons and to ensure the proper functioning of the electrical installation, installing and using personal electrical devices such as heaters, electric grills, mushroom dryers or other equipment that may exceed the permitted load is not allowed without prior notification and consent.</li>
        <li>Due to the nature of the property and for organisational reasons, pets are not accepted. Please take this into account when planning your booking.</li>
        <li>Barbecuing is only permitted in the designated area next to the cottage. After grilling, the embers must be left to cool down naturally, without pouring water on the firebox. Once they have cooled, please empty the ashes into the designated container and clean the grill grate and firebox using the accessories provided on site.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Quiet Hours and Conduct</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Quiet hours are observed from 22:00 to 07:00.</li>
        <li>Quiet, respectful gatherings among Guests are permitted.</li>
        <li>Loud parties and disturbing other Guests are not permitted.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>6. Sauna and Jacuzzi</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Guests may use the sauna free of charge.</li>
        <li>Each sauna session must be booked at least 2 hours in advance so that the sauna can be prepared for the requested time. The booking guarantees exclusive use of the sauna at the agreed time.</li>
        <li>Use of the jacuzzi is optional and subject to an additional fee, according to the <a href="/en#cennik-jacuzzi">price list on lasbialas.pl/en</a>.</li>
        <li>Renting the jacuzzi for the duration of the stay entitles Guests to exclusive and unlimited use around the clock.</li>
        <li>Detailed instructions and rules for using the sauna and jacuzzi are available in each cottage. Please read them before use.</li>
        <li>Failure to comply with the rules may result in loss of the right to use these facilities.</li>
        <li>Use of the facilities is at your own risk.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>7. Bikes and SUP Boards</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Bikes and SUP boards (from May to October) are available to Guests free of charge, without prior booking.</li>
        <li>After use, they must be returned to their designated place.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>8. Guest Liability for Damage</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>The Guest is fully liable for any damage, destruction or missing equipment caused through their fault or the fault of persons they invited or stayed with at the property.</li>
        <li>Damage includes damaged, destroyed or missing equipment, as well as soiling that requires specialist cleaning, ozone treatment, washing or replacement of bed linen, curtains, bedspreads or upholstery, the replacement of items permanently affected by odours or otherwise damaged, and additional cleaning.</li>
        <li>The Guest must inform the Lessor of any damage without delay.</li>
        <li>If damage is found after check-out, the Lessor documents it (including photos and a cost estimate) and sends the documentation to the Guest together with a request to cover the costs.</li>
        <li>The cost of damage is determined on the basis of the purchase price of the damaged item or an equivalent item, the cost of repair or specialist cleaning, and labour costs, if incurred.</li>
        <li>The Guest undertakes to cover the cost of damage within the period specified by the Lessor, which will not exceed 7 days from receipt of the information about the damage.</li>
        <li>If a security deposit has been collected, the cost of damage may be deducted from it.</li>
        <li>If payment is refused, the Lessor reserves the right to pursue the matter through civil proceedings.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>9. Personal Data</h2>
      <p>The controller of personal data is Talem Technologies sp. z o.o., based in Bydgoszcz, Poland. Details are available in the <a href="/en/rodo">GDPR information</a>.</p>

      <h2>10. Final Provisions</h2>
      <p>Making a booking constitutes acceptance of these terms and conditions, available at lasbialas.pl/en/terms-and-conditions.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
